---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import myImage from "../assets/me.jpg";
---

<Section text="About Me" href="about">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12 md:flex-row md:gap-8">
    <p class="w-auto text-base text-neutral md:pr-5">
      Hi, I'm Kenan Mehoub, a passionate Full-Stack Web Developer specializing
      in PHP and Laravel. I design and build high-performance web applications,
      custom management systems, control dashboards, and conversion-focused
      landing pages that turn ideas into real digital products. Over the years,
      I've worked on remote and freelance projects ranging from invoice
      management systems and task tracking dashboards to a full real estate
      platform with a powerful Filament admin panel. I also build secure
      authentication flows using Laravel Sanctum and RESTful APIs, and I
      collaborate smoothly with front-end teams using React, Next.js, and
      Tailwind CSS. My focus is always on clean code, performance, security,
      and scalability — delivering solutions that are both reliable and
      user-friendly.
    </p>
    <div class="h-80 w-64 shrink-0 rotate-[5deg] bg-white p-4 md:rotate-[7deg]">
      <Image
        class="object-cover"
        src={myImage}
        width="260"
        height="260"
        alt="Kenan Mehoub"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>